{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-0","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ついにここまで来たな、愛依","trans":"终于走到这里了啊，爱依","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（さすがに緊張しているな……）","trans":"（果然还是紧张了啊……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6019001010020","name":"愛依","text":"もう切り替えてないと","trans":"必须赶紧调整过来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6019001010030","name":"愛依","text":"じゃないと……ヤバい","trans":"不然的话……就糟了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ここまで来た愛依ならやれる、俺は信じているぞ","trans":"走到这里的爱依一定做得到，我相信你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6019001010050","name":"愛依","text":"……行ってくる……見てて","trans":"……我去了……看着吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}